<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;US PATENT 11331283&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US patent 11331283 is a significant milestone in pharmaceutical innovation, marking the breakthrough in pharmaceutical compositions involving cinacalcet hydrochloride and binders."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CINACALCET HYDROCHLORIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cinacalcet hydrochloride is a calcium-sensing receptor agonist used in treating secondary hyperparathyroidism, known for its poor bioavailability and solubility."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BINDERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Binders are excipients that enhance the solubility and bioavailability of cinacalcet hydrochloride, enabling the creation of a stable and effective formulation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECONDARY HYPERPARATHYROIDISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Secondary hyperparathyroidism is a debilitating condition affecting millions worldwide, characterized by fatigue, weakness, and bone pain."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;USS VALOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"USS Valor is a state-of-the-art naval vessel being commissioned into active service."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. RACHEL KIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Rachel Kim is a renowned pharmacologist whose innovative work on a new pharmaceutical composition has significantly improved the treatment of secondary hyperparathyroidism among sailors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMANDER JAMES 'HAWK' WILSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Commander James 'Hawk' Wilson is the captain of the USS Valor, recognizing Dr. Kim's contributions during the commissioning ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NAVAL BASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Naval Base is the setting for the commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor, where Dr. Kim is honored for her work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHARMACEUTICAL COMPANIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pharmaceutical companies are involved in the research and development of cinacalcet hydrochloride and its compositions, aiming to overcome obstacles such as poor bioavailability and limited solubility."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCHERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Researchers are part of the team working on developing cinacalcet hydrochloride and its compositions, contributing to the breakthrough in pharmaceutical innovation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXPERIMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Experiments are conducted to test the effects of various binders on cinacalcet's solubility and bioavailability, providing evidence for the composition's efficacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data is the result of experiments and research, demonstrating the superiority of the claimed composition in terms of solubility and bioavailability."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMISSIONING CEREMONY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor is a significant event where Dr. Rachel Kim is honored for her contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAILORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sailors are the beneficiaries of Dr. Rachel Kim's innovative formula, recovering from secondary hyperparathyroidism and returning to duty."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMERICAN FLAG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The American Flag is raised during the commissioning ceremony, symbolizing the official welcome of the USS Valor into the naval fleet."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL ANTHEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The national anthem is played during the commissioning ceremony, adding to the solemnity and celebration of the event."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMENDATION PLAQUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A commemorative plaque is presented to Dr. Rachel Kim during the commissioning ceremony, recognizing her contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEALTH AND WELL-BEING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Health and well-being of the sailors is a key focus of Dr. Rachel Kim's work, ensuring they can serve their country effectively."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. KIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Kim is a character who has completed a task and is reflecting on her work while at a naval base."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SMALL TOKEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The small token is a meaningful item to Dr. Kim, symbolizing her accomplishment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUESTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The guests are people who have attended an event or gathering, now dispersing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0114</data>
    </node>
